WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

00:06.580 --> 00:07.980
[Respect Copyright; Everyone's Responsibility]

00:08.360 --> 00:09.800
♪Data is screaming♪

00:09.800 --> 00:11.330
♪Proposals are burning♪

00:11.330 --> 00:13.200
♪I deconstruct the world's algorithms♪

00:13.200 --> 00:14.900
♪Only never counting the heartbeat♪

00:14.900 --> 00:17.160
♪Whose perfect smile is reflected in the glass?♪

00:17.160 --> 00:18.760
♪Treading on shadows as I run ahead♪

00:18.760 --> 00:20.300
♪There's no time to fall♪

00:20.330 --> 00:23.000
♪They say gears should be obedient♪

00:23.100 --> 00:25.660
♪Yet I insist on being the offbeat stopwatch♪

00:25.800 --> 00:29.040
♪Planting my own pride in the cracks of the rules♪

00:29.200 --> 00:31.800
♪Waiting for the night to grow its dawn♪

00:33.200 --> 00:35.930
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

00:35.930 --> 00:37.280
♪No claimed ground, no comparison♪

00:37.280 --> 00:38.660
♪I won't be anyone's footnote♪

00:38.660 --> 00:40.040
♪Though there are thousand of templates♪

00:40.040 --> 00:41.730
♪I choose only the sharpest second♪

00:41.730 --> 00:44.100
♪Answering life as my own thinking question♪

00:44.100 --> 00:46.860
♪I am my own never-landing beacon♪

00:46.860 --> 00:48.320
♪No borrowed light, no offered prayer♪

00:48.320 --> 00:49.530
♪I won't believe in anyone's castle♪

00:49.530 --> 00:50.960
♪Even if the world is an exam hall♪

00:50.960 --> 00:52.800
♪I'll hand in early and run away♪

00:52.800 --> 00:54.100
♪Writing in one single line for the answer♪

00:54.460 --> 00:55.820
♪"I dare to claim it!"♪

01:05.440 --> 01:07.860
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

01:07.860 --> 01:09.400
♪No substitute, no imitation♪

01:09.400 --> 01:10.560
♪I won't trade for anyone's glory♪

01:10.560 --> 01:12.040
♪Though there are thousands of echoes♪

01:12.040 --> 01:13.700
♪I listen only to the loneliest second♪

01:13.700 --> 01:16.000
♪Walking life into my own exclamation mark♪

01:16.000 --> 01:18.760
♪I am my own never-extinguishing lamp♪

01:18.760 --> 01:20.360
♪No wind‑borne drift, no shore‑bound rest♪

01:20.360 --> 01:21.700
♪I won't linger in anyone's course♪

01:21.700 --> 01:23.160
♪Even if there are millions of scripts♪

01:23.160 --> 01:24.960
♪I'll tear them up and rewrite today♪

01:24.960 --> 01:26.060
♪Signing the signature at the end with only♪

01:26.380 --> 01:27.740
♪"I create it!"♪

01:33.400 --> 01:37.980
[Irreplaceable]

01:37.980 --> 01:40.980
[Episode 18]

01:48.390 --> 01:52.840
[Hezong Consulting]

02:07.480 --> 02:07.900
Hi.

02:08.710 --> 02:09.780
How do I set up the fingerprint

02:09.800 --> 02:10.660
for clocking in?

02:11.520 --> 02:11.980
Tap here.

02:31.800 --> 02:32.610
Morning, Richard.

02:37.080 --> 02:37.380
Morning.

02:38.240 --> 02:38.570
Morning.

02:43.470 --> 02:44.380
Richard helped you.

02:44.400 --> 02:45.060
How come you didn't even

02:45.080 --> 02:45.660
say thanks?

02:46.240 --> 02:46.690
He

02:47.030 --> 02:47.730
is the youngest partner

02:47.840 --> 02:49.010
at our firm.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.940
And he's about to become

02:50.960 --> 02:51.940
a senior partner.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.340
I just started.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.500
It's a little awkward.

03:15.710 --> 03:16.130
Morning.

03:17.240 --> 03:17.660
Adjusting okay?

03:18.120 --> 03:18.610
Morning.

03:19.400 --> 03:19.940
It's fine.

03:19.960 --> 03:20.540
I'm just getting familiar

03:20.560 --> 03:21.380
with the OA system.
[*Office Automation]

03:21.800 --> 03:22.540
Here,

03:22.680 --> 03:23.290
only partners

03:23.560 --> 03:24.610
and above

03:24.630 --> 03:25.980
get a fixed desk.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.130
Everyone else

03:28.150 --> 03:29.340
shares desks.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.220
So seating's random.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.890
That's different from Maxmise.

03:33.190 --> 03:33.570
You

03:33.680 --> 03:34.100
can book earlier

03:34.120 --> 03:35.060
on the OA system going forward.

03:36.310 --> 03:37.340
But

03:37.400 --> 03:38.690
there are so many empty seats.

03:40.590 --> 03:41.940
That's because you just started.

03:42.310 --> 03:43.100
Once you're on a project,

03:43.560 --> 03:44.940
a lot of people here

03:45.470 --> 03:46.170
don't come into the office

03:46.590 --> 03:47.690
for a whole month.

03:48.240 --> 03:48.410
Oh,

03:48.630 --> 03:49.540
have you checked out the projects in the pool?

03:50.000 --> 03:50.820
Any you're interested in?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.380
There are dozens of projects.

03:52.470 --> 03:53.610
Can't get through all of them at once.

03:55.240 --> 03:55.450
Sit.

03:56.520 --> 03:56.850
Sit.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.820
Let me recommend

03:59.910 --> 04:00.450
my project.

04:00.870 --> 04:01.890
It's the Huaxin overseas project

04:01.910 --> 04:02.610
for efficiency optimization.

04:03.150 --> 04:04.260
It has a short timeline.

04:04.590 --> 04:05.290
Three to four months.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.450
And it's in the IT industry

04:06.520 --> 04:07.220
you're familiar with.

04:07.910 --> 04:08.690
Remember I told you

04:08.800 --> 04:09.780
I'm always hungry for talent?

04:11.870 --> 04:12.610
I'll check it out right now.

04:14.240 --> 04:14.450
You got this.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.290
One, two. One, two.

04:27.040 --> 04:27.410
One, two.

04:29.270 --> 04:29.700
One, two, three.

04:30.830 --> 04:31.490
Not hard enough. Again!

04:36.480 --> 04:37.020
One, two, three.

04:39.430 --> 04:39.700
Again.

04:39.830 --> 04:40.460
I can't.

04:45.430 --> 04:45.730
Again.

04:46.510 --> 04:47.660
I can't do it.

04:50.870 --> 04:51.810
I barely used any strength.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.020
Are you okay?

04:53.480 --> 04:54.290
Where did I hit you?

04:54.870 --> 04:56.490
I really didn't use any strength.

04:58.680 --> 05:00.020
Speed beats everything.

05:05.800 --> 05:06.930
This is a public place.

05:07.390 --> 05:08.490
It's late. Nobody's here.

05:09.680 --> 05:10.140
Let's

05:10.270 --> 05:11.490
grab dinner together later.

05:12.510 --> 05:13.490
Before your work at Hezong

05:13.600 --> 05:14.410
officially starts,

05:14.870 --> 05:15.250
how about we

05:15.360 --> 05:16.540
take a few days off and go on a trip?

05:17.000 --> 05:17.460
Otherwise,

05:17.600 --> 05:18.850
I'm failing pretty hard at being a boyfriend.

05:20.720 --> 05:22.410
I told you,

05:22.950 --> 05:23.290
I'm

05:23.310 --> 05:24.850
in no mood for a trip lately.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.170
Hey, Yuan.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.610
Sure. No problem.

05:53.070 --> 05:53.610
Let me drive you.

05:55.120 --> 05:55.810
Sorry.

06:12.510 --> 06:13.810
Have you looked through the projects

06:13.830 --> 06:14.460
in the company pool yet?

06:15.870 --> 06:16.810
I filtered some for you.

06:17.360 --> 06:18.580
Mingzhang Petrochemical and...

06:19.160 --> 06:20.340
I picked the Huaxin one.

06:22.920 --> 06:23.460
You already picked?

06:24.160 --> 06:24.460
Yes.

06:25.750 --> 06:26.700
I registered it

06:26.720 --> 06:28.020
on the office system before I got off work.

06:29.000 --> 06:30.660
Wang Yuan said this project has a short timeline.

06:30.680 --> 06:31.290
Only three months.

06:31.310 --> 06:32.020
If I pick it,

06:32.040 --> 06:32.930
I can move up

06:32.950 --> 06:33.700
to project manager faster.

06:34.240 --> 06:34.810
I went back

06:34.830 --> 06:35.540
to that meeting just for this.

07:29.430 --> 07:29.900
Chi.

07:31.190 --> 07:31.490
Didn't you say

07:31.510 --> 07:32.660
you were gonna do the Huaxin project?

07:35.480 --> 07:37.340
I thought about it a lot last night.

07:38.480 --> 07:38.980
Why don't you

07:39.120 --> 07:39.980
reconsider?

07:41.270 --> 07:41.780
Why?

07:42.630 --> 07:43.290
Yes, the Huaxin project

07:43.360 --> 07:44.220
has a short timeline,

07:44.720 --> 07:45.850
but it's based in the Middle East.

07:46.510 --> 07:47.220
It might not be convenient.

07:48.240 --> 07:50.460
Besides, as nice a guy as Wang Yuan is,

07:50.720 --> 07:51.780
he still lacks that decisive edge.

07:52.160 --> 07:53.170
Otherwise, he wouldn't still

07:53.190 --> 07:54.050
be unsigned.

07:54.950 --> 07:56.020
You just joined the company.

07:56.160 --> 07:57.050
You should pick

07:57.070 --> 07:58.290
a project you can easily ease into

07:58.680 --> 07:59.410
and make a splash.

07:59.720 --> 08:00.140
Right?

08:07.480 --> 08:09.850
You've got a point.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.140
But I already talked it over

08:12.160 --> 08:13.140
with him last night.

08:13.390 --> 08:15.020
And I spent all day looking

08:15.040 --> 08:15.810
into Huaxin's materials.

08:16.190 --> 08:17.100
Wouldn't it look bad

08:17.120 --> 08:17.730
if I backed out now?

08:18.270 --> 08:19.220
You can always switch once you've picked

08:19.360 --> 08:20.340
a project in the consultant pool.

08:20.750 --> 08:21.930
People come and go all the time

08:22.070 --> 08:23.540
when a project just starts.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.060
Then

08:33.550 --> 08:34.980
let me figure out how to tell him.

08:36.390 --> 08:36.730
Okay.

08:43.000 --> 08:45.800
[Huaxin Saudi Arabia Drone Project Landing & Efficiency Optimization Support]

09:02.320 --> 09:02.610
Yuan.

09:03.080 --> 09:03.340
Hello.

09:08.120 --> 09:08.530
Yuan.

09:10.440 --> 09:11.370
Uh,

09:12.720 --> 09:14.220
about the Huaxin project,

09:14.390 --> 09:15.730
I might...

09:16.150 --> 09:17.460
I heard from HR

09:17.750 --> 09:19.300
we just onboarded a new female powerhouse?

09:19.600 --> 09:19.890
Yes.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.130
Let me make a proper introduction.

09:21.720 --> 09:23.890
This is Mr. Kai, President of our China Region,

09:24.120 --> 09:24.730
a senior partner.

09:24.910 --> 09:25.650
He just

09:25.670 --> 09:26.650
closed a huge deal in South America.

09:29.150 --> 09:30.100
Hi, I'm Xu Chi.

09:30.320 --> 09:30.580
Hello.

09:31.270 --> 09:31.890
Wang Yuan's an old hand.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.010
Just ask him if you have any questions.

09:33.720 --> 09:34.220
Don't worry about that.

09:34.630 --> 09:36.010
She's already on my Huaxin team.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.650
I'll take good care of her.

09:37.870 --> 09:38.340
That's great.

09:38.510 --> 09:39.130
On the flight back,

09:39.240 --> 09:39.980
I happened to see

09:40.120 --> 09:40.770
the last proposal

09:40.870 --> 09:42.100
Huaxin rejected on the cloud drive.

09:42.480 --> 09:43.340
Personally, I think

09:43.390 --> 09:44.490
some parts could still be improved.

09:46.080 --> 09:46.940
We've got an hour.

09:47.000 --> 09:47.460
Wanna come

09:47.550 --> 09:48.180
discuss it together?

09:49.240 --> 09:49.940
What an honor.

09:53.150 --> 09:53.820
Yu... Yuan.

09:54.550 --> 09:55.100
Hurry up and follow.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.700
Sorry.

10:12.120 --> 10:12.850
I didn't expect

10:12.870 --> 10:14.010
the meeting to run so long.

10:14.840 --> 10:15.180
It's fine.

10:15.790 --> 10:16.580
You just joined.

10:16.600 --> 10:17.340
Why are there so many meetings?

10:24.790 --> 10:27.700
It was the full Huaxin team meeting.

10:28.550 --> 10:29.370
I know

10:29.390 --> 10:30.730
I promised you this morning.

10:31.120 --> 10:32.370
But the second I walked into the office,

10:32.390 --> 10:34.010
I ran into Wang Yuan and...

10:34.080 --> 10:34.580
It's fine.

10:35.270 --> 10:35.700
Eat first.

10:36.080 --> 10:36.340
I ordered

10:36.360 --> 10:37.340
your favorite black cod.

10:38.030 --> 10:39.010
Just let me explain.

10:40.360 --> 10:40.890
No need.

11:10.510 --> 11:11.300
Want some pepper?

11:11.360 --> 11:11.730
No, thanks.

11:36.670 --> 11:37.060
Sorry.

11:38.720 --> 11:39.770
I was silent just now

11:39.910 --> 11:41.100
because I was scared I'd lose control

11:41.120 --> 11:42.010
of my emotions.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.490
Nothing else meant by it.

11:49.510 --> 11:51.100
So just because I didn't listen to you

11:52.270 --> 11:53.460
and still joined the Huaxin team,

11:54.670 --> 11:55.890
you're giving me the cold shoulder.

11:58.750 --> 11:59.180
Of course.

12:00.720 --> 12:00.980
I know

12:01.000 --> 12:02.370
you must have your reasons.

12:03.790 --> 12:04.460
But why do you

12:04.480 --> 12:05.300
trust Wang Yuan so much?

12:06.200 --> 12:07.100
I don't trust him.

12:07.120 --> 12:07.980
Why won't you just hear

12:08.000 --> 12:08.820
my suggestion?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.370
I can explain.

12:10.390 --> 12:10.610
No,

12:11.200 --> 12:11.980
I told you,

12:12.390 --> 12:13.100
the Huaxin project

12:13.670 --> 12:14.250
really has a lot of

12:14.270 --> 12:15.060
built-in problems.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.580
I'm not ignoring your advice!

12:16.600 --> 12:18.420
You're the one who won't hear my explanation!

12:18.480 --> 12:19.060
You have no idea,

12:19.080 --> 12:19.850
but the second I got to the office today,

12:19.910 --> 12:20.890
I got put on the spot.

12:21.000 --> 12:21.460
Okay, okay.

12:22.000 --> 12:22.460
Alright then.

12:23.670 --> 12:24.420
We're both in a bad mood

12:24.440 --> 12:25.060
right now.

12:26.960 --> 12:27.820
I'll go get some air.

12:28.320 --> 12:28.940
Cool off.

12:29.750 --> 12:30.130
Okay?

13:04.940 --> 13:08.220
♪I can forget you♪

13:10.820 --> 13:14.100
♪When the storm has finally passed♪

13:16.850 --> 13:22.540
♪When my heart no longer carries your trace♪

13:26.720 --> 13:27.220
Xu Chi!

13:30.870 --> 13:31.340
Chi!

13:35.540 --> 13:39.060
♪The red light stops me at the crossroads♪

13:41.460 --> 13:47.140
♪Yet I still wish to linger in your eyes♪

13:51.540 --> 13:54.300
♪Back to the days gone by♪

13:54.980 --> 13:57.200
♪Nothing can replace♪

13:57.220 --> 13:59.820
♪The heartbeat you stirred within me♪

13:59.940 --> 14:03.780
♪It still has no expiration date♪

14:06.030 --> 14:07.250
Have you no shame?

14:07.510 --> 14:08.610
Don't give me that!

14:08.910 --> 14:09.770
Are you out of your mind?

14:10.000 --> 14:12.130
This isn't the first time!

14:13.000 --> 14:13.850
I'll go get some air.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.530
Let's both cool off.

14:16.950 --> 14:20.130
♪I am the ruins you left behind♪

14:26.120 --> 14:26.940
We're both in a bad mood

14:26.960 --> 14:27.490
right now.

14:28.870 --> 14:29.490
Cool off.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.530
Your dad doesn't want us anymore.

14:40.670 --> 14:41.460
He found

14:41.480 --> 14:43.730
some young, pretty woman to replace me.

14:44.480 --> 14:48.130
Chi, I've got nothing left.

14:48.150 --> 14:49.180
You've got me.

14:49.550 --> 14:50.420
You've got me.

14:50.530 --> 14:54.660
♪How could another name ever replace yours♪

14:59.380 --> 15:02.460
♪Back to the days gone by♪

15:02.940 --> 15:05.100
♪Nothing can replace it♪

15:05.180 --> 15:07.800
♪A butterfly's wings begin to flutter♪

15:07.860 --> 15:09.270
♪Where waves remain deep beneath the sea♪

15:09.270 --> 15:10.250
She hasn't replied to your messages either?

15:11.240 --> 15:11.700
Miss Bu,

15:12.270 --> 15:13.420
if you get through to her,

15:13.790 --> 15:14.730
please let me know she's okay.

15:15.600 --> 15:15.940
Thanks.

15:17.580 --> 15:20.460
♪Time has turned to ruins♪

15:20.860 --> 15:23.880
♪I keep you deep within my heart♪

15:24.100 --> 15:28.100
♪Forever beautiful through all eternity♪

15:28.120 --> 15:28.700
[Xu Chi]
Sorry.

15:28.720 --> 15:30.250
I got a little worked up just now.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.890
I accidentally turned my phone off.

15:32.120 --> 15:33.060
I'm downstairs at my apartment.

15:33.080 --> 15:33.730
Don't worry.

16:02.150 --> 16:02.580
Sorry.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.610
I shouldn't have done that.

16:11.030 --> 16:12.180
Just now...

16:14.600 --> 16:15.460
Actually,

16:16.150 --> 16:16.980
my dad said

16:17.030 --> 16:18.650
he just wanted to get some air,

16:19.620 --> 16:21.060
and then he never came back.

16:22.100 --> 16:22.890
So I...

16:24.100 --> 16:24.730
It's my fault.

16:25.220 --> 16:25.850
I'm really sorry.

16:27.150 --> 16:27.700
I promise

16:28.500 --> 16:28.730
it won't happen

16:28.750 --> 16:29.580
a second time.

16:30.030 --> 16:30.730
Well, I was planning to

16:30.860 --> 16:32.130
tell Wang Yuan today.

16:32.550 --> 16:34.010
But Mr. Kai suddenly showed up.

16:34.140 --> 16:35.850
He wanted to discuss the Huaxin project.

16:36.380 --> 16:37.890
Wang Yuan just went ahead

16:38.020 --> 16:39.060
and said I was already on the team.

16:39.670 --> 16:41.250
You know, I had no way to just say no

16:41.670 --> 16:43.300
in front of the boss.

16:44.670 --> 16:45.890
Mr. Kai just got back from abroad.

16:46.460 --> 16:47.530
He doesn't know you're my girlfriend,

16:48.100 --> 16:48.890
so that's how he arranged it.

16:49.670 --> 16:50.580
But none of that matters.

16:52.390 --> 16:53.010
I was the one in the wrong.

16:54.260 --> 16:54.610
I shouldn't have

16:54.630 --> 16:55.610
taken my emotions out

16:55.750 --> 16:56.610
on you.

16:57.790 --> 16:58.580
I was just

16:59.380 --> 17:00.340
so scared you'd leave me.

17:02.980 --> 17:03.530
Chi.

17:05.110 --> 17:06.090
Even when hurting this bad,

17:06.700 --> 17:07.620
you still reached out first.

17:08.110 --> 17:09.250
‌I'm nowhere near as good as you at that.

17:09.980 --> 17:10.180
I...

17:10.310 --> 17:11.140
You don't have to say it.

17:15.070 --> 17:15.490
Sorry.

17:17.590 --> 17:18.490
It's okay. Let's drop it.

18:03.590 --> 18:04.180
You really want to

18:04.270 --> 18:05.330
drop out of the Huaxin project?

18:06.460 --> 18:07.290
I'm really sorry.

18:07.790 --> 18:09.380
I only realized it last night

18:09.460 --> 18:10.530
while I was working overtime.

18:10.550 --> 18:11.420
The head of the Chinese review panel

18:11.500 --> 18:12.570
for the Saudi project

18:12.940 --> 18:14.090
Huaxin is bidding on

18:14.110 --> 18:15.940
is my mentor, Professor Yu.

18:17.500 --> 18:18.620
In a situation like this,

18:18.980 --> 18:19.530
the rules say

18:19.590 --> 18:20.700
I have to recuse myself.

18:21.750 --> 18:22.380
Honestly, I really

18:22.460 --> 18:23.220
wanted to join this project.

18:23.940 --> 18:24.620
But...

18:26.940 --> 18:27.940
This is the material I put together

18:27.980 --> 18:28.620
these past few days.

18:28.660 --> 18:29.490
See if it's useful.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.660
Is it really a coincidence?

18:47.180 --> 18:48.220
Woody, is now a good time?

18:49.420 --> 18:49.660
Sure.

18:53.550 --> 18:54.220
It's really a coincidence.

18:55.070 --> 18:55.490
Yuan,

18:56.220 --> 18:57.380
if you ever need me to do anything else,

18:57.420 --> 18:57.860
just say the word.

19:02.350 --> 19:02.730
Okay.

19:08.070 --> 19:09.660
Were you going to see Wang Yuan just now

19:10.110 --> 19:11.700
because you were worried I couldn't bring it up?

19:12.220 --> 19:13.380
You wanted to talk to him privately

19:13.420 --> 19:14.380
and get me off the team?

19:15.500 --> 19:16.090
No.

19:17.270 --> 19:17.700
I figured

19:17.740 --> 19:19.050
since you already joined the project,

19:19.420 --> 19:21.290
I'd dig up some material for Wang Yuan

19:21.790 --> 19:22.900
and see if I could help.

19:25.830 --> 19:26.460
Xinzhi,

19:26.830 --> 19:27.730
from now on, I'll come to you

19:27.790 --> 19:28.660
when something big happens.

19:28.900 --> 19:29.380
Then just

19:29.420 --> 19:30.570
treat me like everyone else.

19:31.030 --> 19:31.900
That way, your team

19:32.020 --> 19:32.810
won't gossip,

19:33.180 --> 19:34.220
and they'll recognize what I can do.

19:43.550 --> 19:44.050
My team?

19:48.110 --> 19:50.380
Tianna chewed me out all night yesterday.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.420
She said

19:51.510 --> 19:53.140
the way I deliberately kept my distance from you

19:53.510 --> 19:54.900
was, just like you said,

19:55.310 --> 19:56.490
a bit too rigid.

19:56.750 --> 19:57.660
Since we're

19:57.720 --> 19:58.660
already together,

19:59.160 --> 20:00.770
and the company doesn't ban couples,

20:01.110 --> 20:01.490
why should I

20:01.550 --> 20:02.730
put myself through the hassle of starting

20:03.070 --> 20:04.220
over with a new supervisor?

20:05.790 --> 20:06.330
Chi.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.010
Hey, honey,

20:09.640 --> 20:10.290
can you

20:10.310 --> 20:12.380
do a private consultation for me?

20:12.960 --> 20:14.140
Tell me

20:14.270 --> 20:15.900
which of the projects under Ye the Legend

20:15.960 --> 20:16.900
fits me best?

20:19.030 --> 20:19.660
All Buy.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.570
They are pivoting

20:22.000 --> 20:23.770
and looking for market consulting services

20:23.830 --> 20:25.300
in the Belt and Road Initiative countries.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.140
I wanna land it.

20:26.920 --> 20:28.660
Then I'll be your best assistant.

20:29.070 --> 20:29.900
And I'll win

20:30.270 --> 20:31.290
my first battle at Hezong.

20:32.960 --> 20:33.380
Welcome.

20:36.550 --> 20:37.010
Chi.

20:38.350 --> 20:39.420
I'm sorry. Before...

20:40.680 --> 20:41.460
Save that line for me.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.860
Maybe joining your team

20:45.000 --> 20:46.090
will cause you a ton of trouble.

20:46.680 --> 20:47.380
It never will.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.860
You're my best assistant.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.090
Irreplaceable.

20:54.550 --> 20:55.050
No.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.700
I wanna be your best partner.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.530
You definitely will be.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.660
Mr. Ye, let me be straight with you.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.570
Your firm's proposal

22:02.680 --> 22:03.460
is actually pretty solid.

22:04.160 --> 22:04.530
And Hezong

22:04.720 --> 22:06.700
is top-tier in consulting.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.290
But a lot of my colleagues

22:08.350 --> 22:09.980
feel Hezong

22:11.070 --> 22:12.050
wouldn't really help us

22:12.110 --> 22:12.660
that much.

22:15.270 --> 22:16.140
Let me put it this way.

22:16.750 --> 22:17.460
We're in

22:17.830 --> 22:18.660
a niche vertical market.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.250
Outside consultants

22:20.440 --> 22:21.490
have a hard time really understanding it.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.290
They'd actually lean more toward

22:23.750 --> 22:24.460
boutique consulting firms

22:24.480 --> 22:25.140
that specialize

22:25.200 --> 22:26.140
in e-commerce solutions.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.140
Mr. Su,

22:28.960 --> 22:30.050
let me be straight with you too.

22:30.830 --> 22:31.860
Consulting

22:32.000 --> 22:33.730
is all about data and experience.

22:34.440 --> 22:34.940
Right now,

22:35.030 --> 22:36.180
your company is focused

22:36.310 --> 22:37.140
on the Southeast Asian market.

22:37.550 --> 22:38.330
But our firm

22:38.350 --> 22:39.700
partnered with major Japanese trading houses

22:40.070 --> 22:41.460
back in the 1990s.

22:42.160 --> 22:42.980
So when it comes to

22:43.030 --> 22:44.460
supply chain resilience

22:44.680 --> 22:47.570
and local food safety regulations,

22:48.000 --> 22:49.770
we understand far more

22:49.830 --> 22:51.570
than these domestic

22:51.640 --> 22:52.460
e-commerce consulting firms do.

22:52.830 --> 22:53.980
I believe that.

22:56.550 --> 22:57.220
How about this?

22:57.830 --> 22:58.810
After I get back,

22:59.720 --> 23:00.860
I'll try to talk them into it.

23:01.440 --> 23:01.770
Alright?

23:04.590 --> 23:05.090
Mr. Su.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.490
Can I add one more thing?

23:10.000 --> 23:10.380
Of course.

23:12.030 --> 23:12.730
Go ahead, Miss Xu.

23:20.270 --> 23:21.290
Actually,

23:21.960 --> 23:23.980
my moniker used to be Junior Wind-Piercer.

23:25.240 --> 23:25.730
Really?

23:27.960 --> 23:28.770
My moniker

23:29.480 --> 23:30.180
was White Dragon Horse.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.290
What a coincidence.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.620
So I've run into an old colleague.

23:34.000 --> 23:34.620
Back before

23:35.070 --> 23:36.180
I spun off

23:36.240 --> 23:37.050
from Youpin Yanxuan,

23:37.680 --> 23:38.530
everyone in the company used

23:38.550 --> 23:40.180
monikers from Journey to the West.

23:41.640 --> 23:43.380
The point I wanna add is that

23:43.790 --> 23:45.380
both Mr. Ye and I have deep

23:45.480 --> 23:46.570
retail experience.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.380
I worked at Youpin Yanxuan.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.700
When Mr. Ye was in charge

23:49.750 --> 23:50.770
of operations at P&J,

23:50.960 --> 23:51.700
he dealt mostly

23:51.880 --> 23:52.860
with warehouses and logistics.

23:53.270 --> 23:54.140
We've both personally

23:54.160 --> 23:55.180
unloaded goods in freezer units,

23:55.550 --> 23:55.860
dealt with

23:55.920 --> 23:57.250
suppliers showing up demanding payment,

23:57.680 --> 23:58.730
and handled goods

23:58.880 --> 23:59.660
ruined by power outages.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.420
When fresh food e-commerce goes overseas,

24:01.480 --> 24:02.490
warehousing, logistics,

24:02.550 --> 24:04.290
and freight management have to be the first things to land.

24:05.030 --> 24:05.570
White Dragon Horse,

24:06.030 --> 24:07.660
Hezong can give your company

24:07.680 --> 24:09.050
the best experience and data.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.490
And our industry background means

24:10.790 --> 24:11.570
we can communicate with you

24:11.680 --> 24:12.660
most efficiently.

24:13.350 --> 24:14.330
Consulting managers

24:14.350 --> 24:14.940
at other firms

24:15.110 --> 24:16.330
might be more familiar

24:16.400 --> 24:16.980
with KOLs,
[*Key Opinion Leaders]

24:17.240 --> 24:17.730
ad spend,

24:17.830 --> 24:18.290
and ROI.
[*Return on Investment]

24:18.920 --> 24:19.730
But they definitely don't know

24:19.830 --> 24:20.940
how to set fairer performance standards

24:21.000 --> 24:22.460
for the fish-gutting station.

24:23.310 --> 24:24.010
And I'd bet

24:24.440 --> 24:26.010
their pitch deck

24:26.240 --> 24:27.140
is just the same one they gave

24:27.200 --> 24:28.380
other e-commerce clients years ago.

24:28.960 --> 24:29.900
It's been polished to death by now.

24:32.070 --> 24:32.940
Don't say that.

24:33.830 --> 24:34.250
What if they

24:34.310 --> 24:35.530
got someone to repackage it?

24:37.030 --> 24:37.660
Let me guess.

24:38.160 --> 24:40.660
Is it the steady, cool blue,

24:41.240 --> 24:42.290
or the energetic red-white-black?

24:44.240 --> 24:45.380
Red-white-black.

24:48.240 --> 24:50.220
Mr. Su,

24:50.400 --> 24:51.570
the All Buy overseas project

24:51.720 --> 24:52.620
is actually a lot like

24:52.750 --> 24:54.330
the Tianhe Airlines project I did before.

24:54.830 --> 24:55.770
Both are about AI efficiency.

24:56.110 --> 24:56.660
So what Chi and I

24:56.720 --> 24:57.530
can guarantee is that

24:57.830 --> 24:58.980
during the project,

24:59.310 --> 25:00.290
we definitely won't

25:00.350 --> 25:01.660
cut so deep we hit a vital artery.

25:12.350 --> 25:12.770
Chi.

25:14.070 --> 25:14.810
You're today's

25:14.830 --> 25:15.380
MVP.
[*Most Valuable Player]

25:16.440 --> 25:17.810
You taught me that.

25:18.160 --> 25:18.700
You told me

25:18.830 --> 25:20.180
a consulting manager's ultimate weapon

25:20.240 --> 25:20.900
is peer talk.

25:21.070 --> 25:21.860
You gotta have common ground

25:21.920 --> 25:22.730
with the client.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.940
Honestly, I only worked at Youpin Yanxuan

25:24.960 --> 25:25.860
for one winter break.

25:26.270 --> 25:26.810
But while browsing

25:26.880 --> 25:27.660
the news online,

25:27.720 --> 25:28.330
I found out that Mr. Su

25:28.350 --> 25:29.180
also came from there.

25:29.400 --> 25:29.810
I figured

25:29.920 --> 25:30.940
that had to be a way in.

25:32.440 --> 25:32.980
That's amazing.

25:35.510 --> 25:36.220
It's probably Mr. Su.

25:44.590 --> 25:44.980
Hello.

25:51.350 --> 25:51.620
Okay.

25:52.750 --> 25:53.700
That should be fine

25:53.750 --> 25:54.420
by 6 PM tomorrow.

25:59.240 --> 26:00.660
Thank you, White Dragon Horse.

26:10.200 --> 26:11.050
Why aren't you asking me?

26:12.920 --> 26:14.250
Because I thought

26:14.640 --> 26:15.700
you couldn't hold it in for 30 seconds

26:15.830 --> 26:16.460
before telling me.

26:17.270 --> 26:18.900
We closed it, Xinzhi!

26:19.440 --> 26:20.530
Mr. Su called and said

26:20.750 --> 26:22.010
their legal director's taking annual leave

26:22.160 --> 26:22.860
this weekend.

26:22.880 --> 26:24.180
So they want

26:24.270 --> 26:25.460
the draft contract sent over ASAP.

26:26.070 --> 26:27.090
We did it!

26:27.310 --> 26:27.860
That's amazing.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.420
It's all thanks to you.

26:28.880 --> 26:29.980
No.

26:30.720 --> 26:31.940
I'm so happy.

26:32.680 --> 26:33.700
I actually did it!

26:34.640 --> 26:35.420
Let me take you somewhere.

27:06.960 --> 27:08.220
You've got some skills.

27:08.310 --> 27:09.700
Give it to me. I'll go.

27:18.480 --> 27:20.050
See? Told you.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.380
I'm really athletic.

27:31.440 --> 27:32.940
That's about all the athletic talent

27:33.920 --> 27:35.180
I've got.

27:58.790 --> 27:59.980
Why did you bring me here?

28:03.750 --> 28:04.730
This is my high school.

28:05.960 --> 28:07.620
I used to come here to play ball all the time.

28:08.680 --> 28:09.700
I want us to know

28:10.310 --> 28:11.730
each other's lives better.

28:27.140 --> 28:32.180
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

28:32.220 --> 28:34.420
♪The crowd at the crossing♪

28:34.960 --> 28:36.220
Have you ever seen a shooting star?

28:38.830 --> 28:39.220
You?

28:42.030 --> 28:42.900
When do you think

28:42.960 --> 28:43.770
a shooting star will come?

28:44.880 --> 28:45.420
No idea.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.220
Why are you looking for one?

28:48.590 --> 28:50.250
That's what they do in idol dramas.

28:50.790 --> 28:51.530
Make a wish.

28:53.500 --> 28:57.400
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

28:57.400 --> 28:58.530
I don't think we need to make a wish.

29:00.680 --> 29:01.940
Because we're already happy right now.

29:03.300 --> 29:05.980
♪Why did you stop again?♪

29:08.580 --> 29:13.230
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

29:13.800 --> 29:18.200
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

29:18.530 --> 29:23.400
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

29:23.400 --> 29:27.000
♪Together with me♪

29:30.630 --> 29:33.730
♪The lights are peeking in♪

29:33.980 --> 29:36.600
♪At your shadow and mine♪

29:36.680 --> 29:38.680
♪Stretching and shrinking, our nervous hearts♪

29:38.720 --> 29:41.500
[All Buy Overseas Project & Hezong Consulting]

29:41.500 --> 29:43.800
[Strategic Partnership Signing Ceremony]

30:02.790 --> 30:03.940
Xu Chi's really something.

30:05.270 --> 30:06.180
She just joined and already landed

30:06.240 --> 30:07.330
an eight-figure project.

30:07.880 --> 30:08.460
But...

30:09.350 --> 30:09.730
Wang Yuan.

30:10.400 --> 30:10.900
Wang Yuan!

30:11.590 --> 30:12.860
Didn't you recommend her for the job?

30:13.270 --> 30:13.620
Who?

30:14.110 --> 30:15.050
Xu Chi.

30:16.550 --> 30:16.810
Yeah.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.220
So what if I recommended her?

30:18.270 --> 30:19.250
I can't beat Richard anyway.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.860
Don't tell me Ye Xinzhi and her are...

30:24.510 --> 30:25.380
Don't talk nonsense.

30:25.920 --> 30:26.570
You quietly

30:26.590 --> 30:27.730
poached Ye Xinzhi's girlfriend

30:27.750 --> 30:28.730
into the company.

30:29.240 --> 30:30.570
You just wanted to use him

30:30.680 --> 30:32.090
to finally crack the Huaxin project

30:32.160 --> 30:33.460
you could never close, right?

30:33.960 --> 30:35.090
You wanted a free favor.

30:35.590 --> 30:36.140
Too bad.

30:36.590 --> 30:37.810
Ye Xinzhi knows to recuse himself.

30:38.270 --> 30:39.420
But the girl

30:39.830 --> 30:41.220
doesn't play by the rules at all.

30:41.680 --> 30:42.980
She's just boldly riding your connections

30:43.070 --> 30:43.980
to get ahead.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.490
Some people

30:46.240 --> 30:47.050
miscalculated.

31:13.350 --> 31:14.330
Slow down when you eat.

31:14.440 --> 31:15.530
I'm not gonna fight you for it.

31:18.750 --> 31:19.420
I have an interview

31:20.000 --> 31:21.460
and research session with a client in Hangzhou later.

31:23.790 --> 31:24.420
Our project team

31:24.480 --> 31:25.010
only has six people.

31:25.830 --> 31:26.570
Ye Xinzhi said

31:27.030 --> 31:28.050
that since the client wants

31:28.160 --> 31:28.980
a lean, streamlined setup,

31:29.310 --> 31:30.250
our team this time

31:30.310 --> 31:30.940
can't be bloated.

31:32.270 --> 31:33.140
How much longer do you have to do this?

31:34.030 --> 31:34.460
Three months.

31:34.680 --> 31:35.460
Three months?

31:37.000 --> 31:37.860
I really miss those days

31:37.960 --> 31:38.900
of leading troops into battle.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.770
I'm practically going moldy from boredom now.

31:41.750 --> 31:42.730
Is Siwei's finance department

31:42.830 --> 31:43.380
that chill?

31:44.400 --> 31:45.010
Not really.

31:45.310 --> 31:46.940
It's just that the accounting department

31:47.000 --> 31:48.090
is doing the annual audit right now.

31:48.550 --> 31:49.730
My mom was worried

31:49.790 --> 31:50.700
that if something got flagged,

31:51.160 --> 31:52.380
I'd get thrown under the bus,

31:52.680 --> 31:53.380
so she had my dad

31:53.480 --> 31:54.530
move me to the R&D department.

31:54.960 --> 31:56.490
But I don't have a STEM background.

31:57.240 --> 31:58.050
They did some kind of

31:58.160 --> 31:59.700
naked-eye 3D stereoscopic test.

32:00.240 --> 32:01.050
Made me so dizzy.

32:01.790 --> 32:02.980
See, I threw up for two days,

32:03.200 --> 32:04.250
took leave, and came to eat with you.

32:07.510 --> 32:09.090
Gotta go. I'm out.

32:19.070 --> 32:19.810
Hello, baby.

32:20.070 --> 32:20.460
Tianna,

32:20.680 --> 32:22.420
I'm calling you from my watch.

32:22.640 --> 32:24.090
Are you being held hostage?

32:25.440 --> 32:26.180
Where are you?

32:26.590 --> 32:27.570
I'm not being held hostage.

32:28.000 --> 32:29.700
I just took first place in my

32:29.720 --> 32:30.570
roller skating competition.

32:31.200 --> 32:32.490
I video-called Dad,

32:32.880 --> 32:33.900
and suddenly

32:34.270 --> 32:35.660
I saw Heng

32:36.110 --> 32:36.980
flash by in the frame.

32:37.310 --> 32:37.940
I was afraid Dad

32:38.000 --> 32:39.090
called him over to yell at him again.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.220
So I got in the car

32:40.510 --> 32:41.980
and rushed to give you a heads-up.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.090
Dad's at the equestrian center.

32:43.350 --> 32:44.490
Hurry over and check!

32:44.920 --> 32:45.770
Heng?

32:59.160 --> 33:01.290
Dad, you've gone too far.

33:02.030 --> 33:03.140
Zhao Heng is just my boyfriend.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.460
He's not your employee.

33:04.590 --> 33:05.770
Is there something so huge

33:05.830 --> 33:06.220
that you had to

33:06.830 --> 33:07.570
call him all the way here

33:07.640 --> 33:08.660
to talk to him alone?

33:09.400 --> 33:09.940
Well,

33:10.400 --> 33:11.330
you should ask him yourself.

33:14.030 --> 33:14.490
Tianna.

33:15.680 --> 33:16.180
Actually,

33:16.880 --> 33:18.490
I came to see Mr. Bu on my own.

33:23.000 --> 33:23.530
Why?

33:27.920 --> 33:28.380
Here's the thing.

33:29.440 --> 33:29.860
I'm on a break

33:29.920 --> 33:31.050
after wrapping up the project.

33:31.440 --> 33:32.620
So I wanted to use Maxmise's database,

33:32.680 --> 33:33.010
my analysis

33:33.030 --> 33:34.250
of Siwei Group,

33:34.550 --> 33:36.090
and my understanding and observations of you

33:36.640 --> 33:37.570
to put together

33:37.830 --> 33:38.770
a small business plan

33:39.350 --> 33:40.250
and succession analysis

33:40.270 --> 33:40.730
for Mr. Bu.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.730
Your observations of me?

33:45.000 --> 33:45.700
So you're saying

33:46.680 --> 33:47.860
you talked to my dad

33:48.880 --> 33:50.490
about my future

33:50.920 --> 33:52.420
at our own company

33:52.510 --> 33:54.460
without my permission.

33:54.790 --> 33:55.220
Is that right?

33:58.310 --> 33:59.050
You could see it that way.

34:00.030 --> 34:00.420
Tianna,

34:02.070 --> 34:03.180
you and Mr. Bu definitely know Siwei Group

34:03.200 --> 34:04.090
better than I do.

34:04.640 --> 34:05.140
But look,

34:05.240 --> 34:05.900
ever since you went back to Siwei Group

34:05.920 --> 34:06.380
a month ago,

34:06.440 --> 34:07.980
you haven't been in a good place.

34:08.000 --> 34:09.650
You've even been a little down.

34:09.880 --> 34:10.650
So I figured

34:11.190 --> 34:11.570
sometimes

34:11.630 --> 34:12.900
I can observe and analyze

34:12.960 --> 34:13.980
from a third-party perspective,

34:14.230 --> 34:15.050
which is better and more objective...

34:15.400 --> 34:16.650
Get lost right now.

34:18.960 --> 34:19.530
Get out!

34:32.190 --> 34:32.610
Mr. Bu,

34:33.710 --> 34:34.650
I'll leave the USB drive here for you.

34:34.920 --> 34:35.740
You can use it as a reference.

34:52.150 --> 34:54.650
Dad, I hope

34:55.840 --> 34:57.090
you can show me a little more respect

34:57.190 --> 34:58.130
from now on.

34:58.440 --> 34:59.900
He's an outsider. You...

35:00.000 --> 35:00.980
Have you thought about

35:01.070 --> 35:03.780
what an outsider gets

35:04.880 --> 35:05.650
out of doing this?

35:05.920 --> 35:07.300
He's just trying to butter you up.

35:07.320 --> 35:09.530
He already admitted he loves you and loves the benefits.

35:09.550 --> 35:11.420
What's wrong with buttering up his future father-in-law?

35:14.110 --> 35:15.690
He... he can't just go over my head like that.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.650
You think

35:18.070 --> 35:19.690
he could keep it a secret that he came

35:19.920 --> 35:20.690
to see me privately?

35:22.670 --> 35:23.170
Na,

35:24.070 --> 35:25.940
you work at the company now.

35:26.510 --> 35:28.260
He's an outsider.

35:30.670 --> 35:31.610
Since you wanna take over,

35:32.800 --> 35:33.420
I suggest you

35:33.960 --> 35:35.380
calm down

35:35.590 --> 35:36.650
and really think this through.

35:36.800 --> 35:37.300
Why would he

35:38.150 --> 35:39.940
come to me privately

35:40.190 --> 35:41.300
knowing it'd make you angry?

35:42.190 --> 35:43.490
And why is he

35:43.760 --> 35:44.490
sticking his nose

35:44.550 --> 35:45.820
into Siwei Group's internal affairs this early?

35:46.190 --> 35:47.300
Isn't he afraid of crossing me?

35:48.190 --> 35:49.130
Isn't he worried you'd be mad?

35:52.360 --> 35:52.940
Maybe

35:54.440 --> 35:55.050
he just

35:56.320 --> 35:57.690
genuinely wants to help you with something.

36:04.320 --> 36:04.740
Honestly,

36:05.320 --> 36:06.050
I still don't like

36:07.360 --> 36:08.780
this kid.

36:09.590 --> 36:10.420
Too calculating.

36:11.030 --> 36:12.010
But even so,

36:13.280 --> 36:14.210
I have to admit

36:14.800 --> 36:15.650
this proposal of his

36:16.400 --> 36:17.460
is pretty good.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.690
A lot of thought went into it. Take a look.

37:11.360 --> 37:11.610
Zhao Heng,

37:11.630 --> 37:12.860
do you know what I hate most?

37:14.670 --> 37:16.170
It's when the person I trust most

37:16.360 --> 37:17.260
goes behind my back

37:17.320 --> 37:18.170
and makes decisions for me.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.380
Who do you think you are?

37:21.840 --> 37:22.130
Yes.

37:23.360 --> 37:24.740
Right now you're my boyfriend.

37:25.070 --> 37:25.980
But so what?

37:33.760 --> 37:34.260
Tianna,

37:35.880 --> 37:37.860
when you left Maxmise,

37:37.920 --> 37:39.130
didn't you hand in your resignation letter

37:39.150 --> 37:39.940
before you even told me?

37:40.510 --> 37:40.860
No...

37:41.150 --> 37:42.090
What I mean is,

37:42.710 --> 37:43.860
if we weren't together,

37:45.110 --> 37:46.170
doing that would've been totally fine.

37:47.510 --> 37:48.650
But we are together.

37:49.110 --> 37:49.420
I was

37:49.440 --> 37:50.530
already your boyfriend then.

37:53.000 --> 37:53.650
Is that why

37:53.670 --> 37:54.780
you decided to get back at me?

37:56.630 --> 37:57.900
You've got some nerve.

37:58.280 --> 37:59.380
Have you been binging those

37:59.400 --> 38:00.010
kept-husband stories?

38:00.400 --> 38:01.010
If I were to break up

38:01.030 --> 38:02.090
with you right now, you'd be...

38:02.590 --> 38:03.460
you'd be a complete nobody.

38:04.070 --> 38:04.740
I'm still me.

38:06.670 --> 38:07.980
Even if we break up, I'm still me.

38:08.660 --> 38:11.580
♪Hey, long time no see♪

38:11.590 --> 38:12.380
Anyway, I came here today

38:12.840 --> 38:13.420
prepared to end things

38:13.480 --> 38:14.460
with you.

38:14.860 --> 38:16.460
♪You don't seem to have changed at all♪

38:17.510 --> 38:18.260
You're threatening me?

38:18.510 --> 38:19.570
I'm not.

38:22.150 --> 38:22.980
I'm trying to survive.

38:26.760 --> 38:27.380
I know

38:28.030 --> 38:29.050
I'm a schemer.

38:30.710 --> 38:31.780
I wanted to climb the ladder

38:31.800 --> 38:32.380
through connections.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.050
But when we

38:34.070 --> 38:35.050
actually got together

38:35.840 --> 38:36.940
and even went through a month of fighting

38:36.960 --> 38:37.740
and the cold shoulder,

38:39.190 --> 38:40.340
I realized I really love you.

38:42.020 --> 38:46.500
♪Though I could never tell what was true♪

38:46.510 --> 38:47.530
But I really can't take

38:47.550 --> 38:48.170
those hurtful words

38:48.590 --> 38:49.380
like "you're flattering yourself"

38:49.550 --> 38:50.780
and "kept man."

38:50.960 --> 38:51.940
I just want equality!

38:51.960 --> 38:53.010
Is that so hard?

38:55.070 --> 38:55.860
You're dead set

38:55.960 --> 38:56.940
on mooching off me.

38:57.480 --> 38:58.380
You're in no position to talk equality.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.130
Bu Tianna!

38:59.920 --> 39:00.690
Your guard's up

39:00.710 --> 39:01.570
way too high,

39:01.590 --> 39:02.690
and you're way too paranoid!

39:03.670 --> 39:04.380
Do you think

39:04.400 --> 39:05.260
that as long as I don't obey you,

39:05.320 --> 39:06.380
I don't love you?

39:07.110 --> 39:08.650
What happened to basic respect

39:08.670 --> 39:09.610
between people?

39:10.360 --> 39:11.010
If I were really

39:11.030 --> 39:12.380
just using you to get ahead,

39:12.440 --> 39:12.820
then I'd...

39:13.150 --> 39:14.170
I'd just lie through my teeth

39:14.190 --> 39:15.780
and keep you happy!

39:16.670 --> 39:17.420
But that kind of love

39:17.440 --> 39:19.090
won't last.

39:19.670 --> 39:21.130
It's exactly because I really love you

39:21.190 --> 39:22.860
that I did this, even knowing

39:22.920 --> 39:24.090
you might break up with me.

39:24.360 --> 39:25.740
I don't wanna wait five years, ten years,

39:25.920 --> 39:26.420
until maybe

39:26.440 --> 39:27.340
I don't even like

39:27.440 --> 39:28.130
or love you anymore,

39:28.230 --> 39:28.940
and then end up

39:29.110 --> 39:30.380
sad and heartbroken!

39:35.680 --> 39:39.440
♪Hey, long time no see♪

39:39.440 --> 39:40.570
I'm gambling, you know?

39:43.030 --> 39:43.820
That USB drive

39:44.320 --> 39:45.490
is my parting gift to you.

39:47.150 --> 39:47.780
I really put

39:47.880 --> 39:49.690
serious thought, real effort,

39:49.760 --> 39:50.420
and a professional eye

39:50.550 --> 39:51.420
into helping you plan

39:51.440 --> 39:52.300
your career

39:52.440 --> 39:54.300
and Siwei's overall future.

39:54.950 --> 39:58.630
♪I'm still wearing it close to my heart♪

39:58.630 --> 39:59.380
But I lost the bet.

40:02.300 --> 40:08.200
♪I miss all the things you used to say♪

40:10.280 --> 40:10.610
Also,

40:11.880 --> 40:13.050
in the year I've been with you,

40:13.840 --> 40:14.940
have I ever spent a single cent of your money?

40:15.230 --> 40:17.030
♪Maybe a joke♪

40:17.030 --> 40:18.050
Have I ever done a single thing

40:18.190 --> 40:19.170
to wrong you?

40:19.170 --> 40:20.950
♪Somehow ended up being taken seriously♪

40:20.950 --> 40:23.950
♪One street, then another♪

40:24.380 --> 40:28.430
♪I didn't know what to do♪

40:28.880 --> 40:32.250
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

40:32.600 --> 40:35.380
♪And I was left feeling uneasy♪

40:35.830 --> 40:41.500
♪Only the sound of rain was left to touch me♪

40:42.630 --> 40:45.600
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

40:45.880 --> 40:50.700
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

40:50.700 --> 40:54.680
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

40:56.960 --> 40:58.170
What am I supposed to do?

41:00.880 --> 41:02.300
Is Zhao Heng genuinely heartbroken

41:02.360 --> 41:03.530
and wants to break up, or

41:04.110 --> 41:05.460
is he just backing off

41:06.280 --> 41:07.570
to force me to cave later?

41:09.480 --> 41:10.490
Your whole situation is a little

41:10.510 --> 41:11.530
too complicated.

41:12.670 --> 41:14.740
With the little relationship experience I've got,

41:15.590 --> 41:16.380
I'm not sure

41:16.400 --> 41:16.940
what to do either.

41:22.710 --> 41:23.650
Sorry, I...

41:24.400 --> 41:24.900
I knew

41:24.960 --> 41:25.980
you just started a new project,

41:26.030 --> 41:26.820
and I still called you out.

41:28.150 --> 41:28.900
What are you saying?

41:29.710 --> 41:31.260
Nothing matters more than you.

41:33.770 --> 41:35.280
[Lin, Maxmise]

41:40.440 --> 41:40.940
Lin.

41:42.320 --> 41:42.940
I don't know

41:43.000 --> 41:44.090
if you and Tianna know about this, but...

41:45.480 --> 41:46.050
Hang on.

41:48.670 --> 41:49.090
Go ahead.

41:50.480 --> 41:51.570
I just heard from Lu Le

41:51.670 --> 41:52.340
that Zhao Heng joined

41:52.400 --> 41:53.460
her Haiji Petroleum project.

41:53.550 --> 41:54.980
He's heading to

41:55.030 --> 41:55.860
the Venezuela project site today.

41:56.110 --> 41:56.690
And with this project,

41:56.800 --> 41:58.130
he'll be in South America

41:58.150 --> 41:58.860
for at least two months.

42:00.110 --> 42:00.740
South America?

42:02.480 --> 42:02.980
Lin,

42:03.070 --> 42:04.210
can you check

42:04.230 --> 42:04.610
the OA system

42:04.630 --> 42:04.980
and see

42:05.000 --> 42:06.340
when Zhao Heng booked his ticket?

42:07.280 --> 42:08.090
Sure, hang on.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.210
He booked it three days ago.

42:13.880 --> 42:14.690
But two hours ago,

42:14.800 --> 42:15.460
he changed it

42:15.510 --> 42:16.820
to tonight's 8 PM flight.

42:21.800 --> 42:22.420
Eight.

42:22.880 --> 42:23.780
Got it. Thanks, Lin.

42:23.800 --> 42:24.300
I'm hanging up.

42:31.030 --> 42:32.490
So he really was gambling.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.980
He had already made his decision.

42:35.320 --> 42:37.170
He just finally gave up just now.

42:38.400 --> 42:39.780
Venezuela.

42:40.480 --> 42:42.780
Halfway across the world. Two months.

42:44.480 --> 42:45.490
Isn't that a perfect

42:45.590 --> 42:46.900
breakup cooling-off period?

42:47.840 --> 42:48.690
I don't think

42:48.760 --> 42:49.650
that's what he meant.

42:50.480 --> 42:51.300
He...

42:52.510 --> 42:54.260
It's fine.

42:55.000 --> 42:55.940
It's just a breakup.

42:56.030 --> 42:57.050
Who hasn't been through one?

42:57.630 --> 42:58.900
He chose to break up with me

42:58.960 --> 42:59.780
this way.

43:00.190 --> 43:01.690
If I drag it out,

43:02.030 --> 43:02.980
I'd be so pathetic.

43:10.630 --> 43:11.490
It's fine, really.

43:46.780 --> 43:51.660
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

43:51.940 --> 43:56.820
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

43:57.060 --> 44:05.380
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

44:07.700 --> 44:12.620
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

44:12.780 --> 44:17.700
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

44:17.740 --> 44:22.300
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

44:22.540 --> 44:27.420
♪Why did you stop again?♪

44:28.020 --> 44:32.660
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

44:33.380 --> 44:37.740
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

44:37.780 --> 44:42.780
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

44:43.100 --> 44:47.980
♪Together with me♪

44:48.740 --> 44:53.620
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

44:54.140 --> 44:58.700
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

44:58.740 --> 45:03.300
♪You steal glances at me. You like me, right?♪

45:03.580 --> 45:08.460
♪Stop running away♪

45:29.580 --> 45:34.740
♪The sky slowly brightens, falling into our eyes♪

45:34.900 --> 45:39.740
♪The wind gradually stops, and finally it clears up♪

45:40.020 --> 45:45.060
♪The evening breeze brushes past your shoulder, and you turn your head♪

45:45.940 --> 45:51.060
♪You're irreplaceable♪

45:51.060 --> 45:52.060
MkvDrama.net
